    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1341">

                <pb facs="1056" n="940" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg940"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/790.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 26, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to the Department’s unnumbered
                    communication of July 28 regarding [etc.], I have the honor to call the
                    Department’s attention to my despatch of August 13 with enclosures; also to my
                    Cablegram August 6; also to various other communications on this matter.</p>
                <p>The results of the representations may be summarized from the closing clauses of
                    the document<anchor n="80" xml:id="d1341-f1"/> from the Secretaría de Hacienda y
                    Crédito Público dated the 29th of last July which is to the effect that mining
                    properties will be allowed until the 31st of August to pay their pending taxes;
                    and that those who apply directly to the Department here, giving sufficient
                    reason for reduction of taxes, will be allowed the reduction, considering the
                    circumstances attending each particular case.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John R. Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1341-f1" n="80" xml:id="d1341-f1-content">
                <p>Quoted In Inclosure 2 with Mr. Silliman’s August 13.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
